{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "15", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "08", "M": "39", "S": "12"}}, "news": [{"title": "Ahmedabad civic body renews push for building safety", "para": "Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation has reiterated the need for structural safety inspections of buildings over 15 years old. Owners are required to have their structures inspected by qualified engineers and submit certificates. Previous attempts at enforcing compliance have not been effective, with little action taken by building management. Without strict enforcement, voluntary compliance remains low, hindering safety protocols.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/ahmedabad-civic-body-renews-push-for-building-safety/134956619?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-206840/134956619.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Bhubaneswar development body to adjust application fee with flat cost", "para": "The Bhubaneswar Development Authority has updated its fee structure for the Ekamra Residency project. Applicants who are approved will have their Rs 10,000 fee deducted from the total flat price. Those who do not qualify will receive a complete refund of their earnest deposit and application fee. Additional benefits include GST exemptions and lower stamp duty rates. Applications are now open for this housing initiative at Subudhipur.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/bhubaneswar-development-body-to-adjust-application-fee-with-flat-cost/134956546?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-179558/134956546.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Finish pending rural housing projects in week: Bihar rural development minister", "para": "Rural Development Minister Shravan Kumar held a meeting to assess key schemes designed to boost housing and social welfare initiatives. He ordered officials to finalize all pending housing projects within the week, targeting eligible beneficiaries without delays. Kumar also stressed the importance of timely MGNREGA payments and initiated an inquiry into beneficiaries who were overlooked.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/finish-pending-rural-housing-projects-in-week-bihar-rural-development-minister/134956493?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-324010/134956493.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}